Z||000001||edbone||12-30-2001||11:29 PM||||any stereo store should be able to do it for you, But be aware, they may up the labor and bad mouth it to death just because you didnt buy it from them. Im part owner of a sound and security shop and I hate to say thats common practice in this buisness. But you should pay of about an average from 100 to 150 to get ir installed.||||reg||1
