Z||000003||85ZainoGT||12-30-2001||11:32 PM||||Crimestopper.. its the onewith the LED display keychain and all that fun stuff.. you knwo what im talkin bout?  so far only one place I have called will do it for me, $125.. lookin to see if I could get it down a bit..<P>------------------<BR>Paul Ventimiglia<BR>1987 GT all the options :)<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpicNEW3bsmall2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||avengador1||12-31-2001||09:29 AM||||If you buy an alarm system from <A HREF="http://www.crutchfield.com" TARGET=_blank>www.crutchfield.com</A>  they give you detailed instructions on the installation, plus you can call them if you still have any questions. They carry the Crimestopper brand and even have FM pager systems and keyless entry. Im thinking of getting one for my car. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||88CoupeV6||12-31-2001||09:49 AM||||I got a nice alarm with a lcd remote that pages you if the alarm gose off. I have yet to install it. Toooooooooooo cold out  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88coupeV6.jpg">       <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>    <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/nefa.htm" TARGET=_blank>Join New England Fiero Association</A>||||reg||9
Z||000006||SHarperFieroGT||12-31-2001||01:06 PM||||I got a remote start with keyless entry and alarm and everything off of ebay. it came with barely any instructions so i tried to take it to Best Buy for them to install it.  Did you know in Maryland its illegal to install a remote starter on a stick?  so after they turned me down i went out to my car with a test light and lots of splice connectors, it took me a day and a half to install all of the features but it works really well!  Just never park the car in gear!!!  i love to get into a warm car on cold winter mornings!!  If ya need any help finding out what wire is which feel free to ask!  <BR>Goodluck,<BR>SHarper||||reg||1
Z||000007||LoW_KeY||12-31-2001||01:24 PM||||Bought mine at Best buy and had them install it to many wires for me to play with  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> had it all done and in the car in under 1 hr.<P>The systems was $240 and I got it discounted for $90 bucks when I worked there, but I'm pretty sure it wouldn't be that costly to have them do it.<P>------------------<BR>AIM: FierFormula88   <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/low_keysig.gif"> ||||reg||1
